    "snowbird": {
      "status": "ok",
      "resort": "Snowbird",
      "adapter": "powdr",
      "updatedAt": "2026-04-24 05:06:26",
      "note": "Top of the morning to you, spring shredders! This is Gwen with your Snow Report for Friday, April 24. Spring snow showers brought us 2 inches of snowfall yesterday, and there’s a slight chance of snow showers today. Expect a mostly sunny day with a high near 47 and west winds at 7 to 13 mph. Tonight should be partly cloudy, with a low around 26. Heads up for spring mountain operations – that’s 8 am to 2 pm for the Tram, Peruvian & Little Cloud and 8 am to 1 pm for the Tunnel & Mineral. Starting after this Sunday, Snowbird will be closed Monday – Thursday and reopen for weekend operations, May 1 – 3. Conditions will be assessed week-by-week to determine a closing date. Today’s the day for the Used Gear Drive with SOS Outreach . Drop your lightly used soft goods on the Plaza Deck from 10 am – 3 pm to lift up the next generation of skiers and riders. Plazapalooza continues this weekend, kicking off today from 1 – 4 pm with tunes from one of my faves, Mitokandrea. While squeezing out the last days of the 2025-26 season, don’t forget to secure your 2026-27 Season Pass by May 13. Besides the best pricing, that’s the deadline for the $100 renewal credit and Early Bird Benefits. As a reminder, please avoid the Chickadee Bowl area, which is currently under construction on a new lift. If you plan to park above Chickadee or in the Superior Lot, your ski-in/ski-out access will be available along the Bypass Road further down Entry 4. ALL uphill travel is closed. Late-season conditions exist, so please remember to ski and ride in control. Thanks for enjoying spring at Snowbird with us.",
